<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on SBC shares.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on SBC shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Zurich said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on SBC registered shares.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    265 CHF		   PREMIUM	10.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.15 CHF		  GEARING	12.6 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	06.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  259.5 CHF  NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   UIYY</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
